  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.4 stable: Transitive dep-bump to SpawnDev.RTC 1.1.4 to force the browser `BrowserRtpSender.SetParameters` codecs-required-present fix through the chain for consumers with lock files or version pins. No source changes in SpawnDev.RTC.Server itself. See SpawnDev.RTC 1.1.4 release notes for the fix details, and the companion 1.0.3 release for the big STUN/TURN feature bundle (which remains unchanged in content and production-validated at hub.spawndev.com). See CHANGELOG.md for full history.",
